  "control": {
    "$type": "dimension",
    "$description": "ADR-126 section 4 and ADR-127 section 6: the five control role variables (height, padding-inline, icon-size, gap, font-size). Every control reads only these and never a density or step token directly. They default to the resolved md tokens (font-size defaults to the ladder md, --bw-font-size-md); a size class (bw-<component>--size-<step>) or a control container re-points them for its subtree; font-size re-points at --bw-font-size-<same step>, never a per-component table. Not a public option and not a new axis: authors still write size. Emitted on :root and re-emitted inside every [data-density] block so a density scoped to a subtree re-resolves them.",
    "height": {
      "$value": "var(--bw-size-control-height-md)"
    },
    "padding-inline": {
      "$value": "var(--bw-size-control-padding-inline-md)"
    },
    "icon-size": {
